flowchart LR
  Page[当前页面] --> Profile[地域展示配置]
  Profile --> Entity[国家实体·世界内语言]
  Profile --> Text[现实文本语言·资源]
  Profile --> Route[沉浸式国家路径]
  Profile --> Currency[LMD + 绑定币种]
  Profile --> Skin[日期·节目册·局部装饰]
  Entity --> Page
  Text --> Page
  Route --> Page
  Currency --> Page
  Skin --> Page
  Page --> Evidence[证据/档案/编辑对照]
  Evidence --> Status[官方/工作译/推拟/待审]
  Status --> Page
